  "material": true,
  "note": "YouTube caption 'in fact December 16th 10 as actually when she hosted her first Zoom call' is garbled; HappyScribe reads 'September [16th] ... was actually when she hosted her first Zoom call'. Countdown was to Sept 16, so 'December 16' is wrong.",
  "fix": {
   "claim": "The host says September 16 turned out to be when Erika hosted her first Zoom call as the new CEO and chairman, though she is sure the '10 days until September 16th' countdown originally referred to some other plan.",
   "label": "Host Says Sept 16 Was Erika's First Zoom Call As CEO And Chairman"
  }
